# skills: Jian at level 9 (level index 8 pinned) casts Weapon Break in the first temple battle (five enemies).
# Special opens the spell list (Weapon Break, 8; it is the only entry at this level, so Down leaves the
# highlight on it, shot wb_list_down: Armor Break comes at level 14), A opens the enemy grid, Right moves to the second back-row
# enemy (battler 5), A casts on it. Expect: Jian's battle MP 10 -> 2, battler 5's ATK stage 0 -> -1 (0xFFFF)
# and its ATK 20 -> 16, no other stage changes. Jian leaps up to it, kicks without damage, and the ATK DOWN
# banner shows on it. The repeat cast is test_skill_cap. Battle records are at 0x0228E860 in this battle (0x6C each:
# MP +0x18, effective ATK +0x24, ATK stage +0x40). Run with --save.
include boot_from_save
include cheats_strong
include warp6
include cheats_strong
pin u32 0x020B4664 8
wait 270
peek u32 0x020B8620 records
watch u32 0x0228E878 jian_mp
watch u16 0x0228EA50 stage4
watch u16 0x0228EABC stage5
watch u32 0x0228EAA0 atk5
watch u16 0x0228EB28 stage6
watch u16 0x0228EC00 stage8
watch u16 0x0228EC6C stage9
watch u16 0x0228ECD8 stage10
press A 8
wait 50
press Right 8
wait 50
press A 8
wait 50
shot wb_list
press Down 8
wait 30
shot wb_list_down
press A 8
wait 70
shot wb_grid
press Right 8
wait 20
shot wb_grid_right
press A 8
wait 120
shot wb_cast
wait 200
shot wb_after
